WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.206
Riley: Oh dear. What should we do?

2
00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:10.212
Skyler: Maybe we'd better go back home.

3
00:00:10.213 --> 00:00:20.084
Kelli: No way! I'm meeting Curtis at the pet shop!

4
00:00:20.085 --> 00:00:23.454
Ben: We can still have fun at the birthday party.

5
00:00:23.455 --> 00:00:27.585
Sarah: Even if we only have eight things.

6
00:00:27.586 --> 00:00:32.390
Riley: Besides, I made a promise to Goldie and Goofy.

7
00:00:32.391 --> 00:00:38.255
Ben: What did you promise?

8
00:00:38.256 --> 00:00:45.778
Riley: That they could go to the pet shop!

9
00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:49.216
Theo: We're almost there.

10
00:00:49.217 --> 00:00:56.473
Sarah: I hope we can still get prizes.

11
00:00:56.474 --> 00:00:58.401
Skyler: What's wrong, Ben?

12
00:00:58.402 --> 00:01:00.710
Ben: I can't find my socks.

13
00:01:00.711 --> 00:01:03.004
I had them in my jacket pocket.

14
00:01:03.005 --> 00:01:06.095
Now they're gone! Kelli:

15
00:01:06.096 --> 00:01:09.016
Will you kids hurry up? Sarah:

16
00:01:09.017 --> 00:01:13.073
But we can't go without Ben's socks.

17
00:01:13.074 --> 00:01:16.329
Riley: Snooks is gone too.

18
00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:21.182
Sarah: There he is!

19
00:01:21.183 --> 00:01:24.121
Ben: Hey, he's got my socks.

20
00:01:24.122 --> 00:01:34.219
Kids: Snooks! Snooks, come back!

21
00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:38.038
Sarah: Snooks chewed up Ben's socks.

22
00:01:38.039 --> 00:01:41.955
Riley: Snooks, you are usually a good boy.

23
00:01:41.956 --> 00:01:48.138
But today you are bad!

24
00:01:48.139 --> 00:01:50.621
Snooks: Woof! Woof!

25
00:01:50.622 --> 00:01:56.452
Theo: Snooks has a new friend.

26
00:01:56.453 --> 00:02:06.564
Kelli: Oh! What a cute kitty!

27
00:02:06.565 --> 00:02:09.918
Ben: Look, the other dog is eating the cupcakes!

28
00:02:09.919 --> 00:02:17.934
Kelli: Hey, I made those cupcakes!

29
00:02:17.935 --> 00:02:20.047
Riley: I can't believe it.

30
00:02:20.048 --> 00:02:24.246
The cupcakes are gone.

31
00:02:24.247 --> 00:02:27.328
Ben: My turtle socks are ruined.

32
00:02:27.329 --> 00:02:31.803
Skyler: And Snooks dug up the flowers.

33
00:02:31.804 --> 00:02:39.005
Riley: This is the worst day of my life!

